      "message": "how about?\n\nWhen the AP comes up after G3 and since the disconnect flag is\nset, EC sends disconnect info to the AP probe functions. But the\nDUT is still in low power mode thus the AP doesn\u0027t receive the current mux state hence enumeration of USB4/TBT device fails when hotplugged at G3. This CL ensures that latest mux state is sent instead of the disconnect mux state.",
